Vendored / adapted in:

  pocketdesk/session.py
      Adapted from scripts/coredevice_session.py.
      Kept: the RPPairing frames, TLV8 encoding, pair-verify (X25519 + Ed25519 +
      ChaCha20-Poly1305 + HKDF) and createListener request construction.
      Changed: removed the hard-coded /var/minis and /root/.cdtk paths in favour
      of portable XDG locations; dropped the CoreDeviceSession class, which
      dials through UserspaceDialPlane (that relay deadlocks in some userland
      network stacks — see docs/PITFALLS.md D3/D4).

  pocketdesk/tls_psk_proxy.js
      Copied verbatim. Node.js TLS-PSK to unix-socket relay bridge.

  pocketdesk/tunnel.py
      Originally derived from the same toolkit's session layer, then largely
      rewritten: it drives RemotePairingTcpTunnel + UserspaceTun.connect_tcp()
      directly and supplies its own asyncio stream adapters, instead of using
      UserspaceDialPlane.

