imports its public modules (remote tunnel service, userspace tunnel, RSD,
SpringBoard and diagnostics services). Because pymobiledevice3 is GPL-3.0,
downstream redistribution that bundles it must comply with GPL-3.0 as well;
pocketdesk itself only imports it at runtime and does not include its source.

